    dznorm:expressedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/law/1984-06-09/84-11#art_37> .

<https://legal.dz/resource/law/1984-06-09/84-11#art_37_para_0> a dzdoc:Paragraph ;
    dzdoc:directlyContainedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/law/1984-06-09/84-11#art_37> ;
    dzdoc:position 0 ;
