    dznorm:conditionText "بناء على طلب من له مصلحة"@ar ;
    dznorm:expressedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/law/1984-06-09/84-11#art_84> ;
    dznorm:position 0 .

<https://legal.dz/resource/law/1984-06-09/84-11#art_84_condition_0_8be6a682_role_acd111df6b> a dznorm:Role ;
